key E

#Notes
// Performance key E by request; this matches the workbook key. The original chart was in F.
// Workbook note: occasional 2/4 and passing chords; exact short bars are not marked in this chart.
> The instrumental after chorus 2 is for the prayer for dreams.
> First chorus: add bass and support singers. Chorus after verse 3: full band and all voices.
> After the first bridge x2, swell out on the tag. Sing two choruses: first acoustic guitar and Sis Angel only, then all in with all voices. Build for four, then eight, into the second chorus.
> Finish with one more bridge, two “You are faithful” tags, slow the last tag into the ending swell.

